     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Hi Max,</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Thank you for asking.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">I guess to use stretch=&quot;lin&quot; with plotRGB() can help you.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">The function fieldCrop() works well with your image in my computer. <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Could you share your script with us?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><br></span></p><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">EX1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stack</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test_orthomosaic.data.tif&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">EX1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># layer 6 it&#39;s not necessary</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>plotRGB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">EX1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stretch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;lin&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>EX1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Crop</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fieldCrop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mosaic </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> EX1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fast</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># &quot;fast.plot = T&quot; Fast plotting step</span></div></code></div></blockquote><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Let me know if you have any other question,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Filipe<u></u><u></u></span></p><div><br></div></div>"
